@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@internalApiKey = REPLACE_WITH_THE_VALUE_FROM_YOUR_LOCAL_ENV

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login as student (form fields; update demo password if it differs locally)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=demo&password=Demo123!

### Login as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=AdminDemo123!

### Authenticated profile (paste access_token from the response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin endpoint: should return 403 when using a student token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Internal endpoint: never expose this route through the public API Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/1
X-Internal-API-Key: {{internalApiKey}}
